  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "8244700",
      "title": "Sending a POST Request with Order Data",
      "sourceHash": "f72b08e4f2650bcac59c0319dddc1b0acb49ba62b318fbf7818d964277abb3b3",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.51,
          "end": 2.97,
          "en": "So how can we now send this data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.97,
          "end": 5.523,
          "en": "along with the cart data to the backend?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.69,
          "end": 11.69,
          "en": "Well, in the end, in a similar way as we loaded our meals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.79,
          "end": 15.96,
          "en": "though this time not inside of such a Effect function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.96,
          "end": 18.93,
          "en": "because this time we don't really need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.93,
          "end": 21.66,
          "en": "to run this when the component loads,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.66,
          "end": 23.82,
          "en": "but instead we wanna send a request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.82,
          "end": 26.67,
          "en": "from inside handleSubmit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.67,
          "end": 29.85,
          "en": "So it's inside of this handleSubmit function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.85,
          "end": 33.78,
          "en": "where we wanna use the fetch function to send the request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.78,
          "end": 35.433,
          "en": "to that dummy backend here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.66,
          "end": 40.38,
          "en": "And there it's slash orders we wanna target",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.38,
          "end": 43.74,
          "en": "because that's the route in this dummy backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.74,
          "end": 48.003,
          "en": "that waits for such incoming order requests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.9,
          "end": 53.13,
          "en": "We should send a post request to this route to be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.13,
          "end": 54.81,
          "en": "and we should make sure then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.81,
          "end": 58.65,
          "en": "that the request body has a order property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.65,
          "end": 61.35,
          "en": "with the details about the order,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.35,
          "end": 64.08,
          "en": "and that should then in turn be an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.08,
          "end": 67.8,
          "en": "that has a items property holding the cart items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.8,
          "end": 69.42,
          "en": "that were ordered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.42,
          "end": 73.11,
          "en": "and a customer property with all the customer details",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.11,
          "end": 75.303,
          "en": "that were entered in the checkout form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 77.28,
          "end": 80.13,
          "en": "So back in the Checkout component on our frontend,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.13,
          "end": 82.65299999999999,
          "en": "we now need to configure this request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 83.52,
          "end": 87.12,
          "en": "We did not have to do that before in the meals file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 87.12,
          "end": 89.94,
          "en": "because the default without configuration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.94,
          "end": 93.483,
          "en": "is that fetch sends a get request to this route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.47,
          "end": 96.18,
          "en": "But we now need to configure it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.18,
          "end": 98.97,
          "en": "because we need to change the request method now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.97,
          "end": 100.413,
          "en": "from get to post.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.24000000000001,
          "end": 105.09,
          "en": "In addition we should now also add some headers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.09,
          "end": 108,
          "en": "to add the Content-Type header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108,
          "end": 111.31,
          "en": "and set it to application/json like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 112.35,
          "end": 114.33,
          "en": "so that the backend understands",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.33,
          "end": 117.21000000000001,
          "en": "that we're submitting some data in JSON format,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.21000000000001,
          "end": 119.613,
          "en": "and it should be extracted accordingly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 121.08,
          "end": 124.08,
          "en": "And of course, we need to set that request body",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 124.08,
          "end": 126.423,
          "en": "so that data that should be attached.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 127.832,
          "end": 131.07,
          "en": "And as mentioned, that should be in JSON format,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 131.07,
          "end": 134.01,
          "en": "and you can easily generate data in that format",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.01,
          "end": 136.68,
          "en": "with the built-in JSON.stringify method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 136.68,
          "end": 139.92000000000002,
          "en": "which now takes any standard JavaScript value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 139.92000000000002,
          "end": 141.84,
          "en": "to convert it to JSON,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.84,
          "end": 143.97,
          "en": "and the value that should be converted here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.97,
          "end": 145.26,
          "en": "should be an object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.26,
          "end": 147.87,
          "en": "which as mentioned a couple of seconds ago,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 147.87,
          "end": 151.41,
          "en": "should have an order property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.41,
          "end": 153.75,
          "en": "which should hold a nested object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 153.75,
          "end": 157.473,
          "en": "with a items property and a customer property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.42000000000002,
          "end": 162.87,
          "en": "Now the customer property in the end should simply include",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.87,
          "end": 166.173,
          "en": "this customer data object which we're getting from our form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 167.22,
          "end": 169.17000000000002,
          "en": "Because with that we'll then have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 169.17000000000002,
          "end": 173.46,
          "en": "all these form input fields as key-value pairs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 173.46,
          "end": 175.473,
          "en": "in that customer data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.76,
          "end": 179.7,
          "en": "And one thing we should actually change here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 179.7,
          "end": 183.723,
          "en": "is that on the app backend I'm looking for a name field,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 184.83,
          "end": 187.2,
          "en": "but in my frontend here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 187.2,
          "end": 190.83,
          "en": "I named that field full-name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 190.83,
          "end": 193.26,
          "en": "We should change this to just name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 193.26,
          "end": 197.07,
          "en": "so that extracting that data and using that data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 197.07,
          "end": 199.98,
          "en": "in the backend code works fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 199.98,
          "end": 202.59,
          "en": "So all the fields I'm looking for here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 202.59,
          "end": 204.24,
          "en": "on that customer data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 204.24,
          "end": 206.67000000000002,
          "en": "that should be the names of your form fields",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 206.67000000000002,
          "end": 207.873,
          "en": "in the checkout form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 208.71,
          "end": 211.14,
          "en": "So make sure that's the case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 211.14,
          "end": 213.87,
          "en": "But with that, that's the customer data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 213.87,
          "end": 216.57,
          "en": "and for the items it's of course now the cart data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 216.57,
          "end": 218.01,
          "en": "which I wanna submit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 218.01,
          "end": 222.39,
          "en": "the cart items which we can get from our cart context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 222.39,
          "end": 225.453,
          "en": "So here it's cartCtx.items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 226.65,
          "end": 229.173,
          "en": "and that's the data that should be submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 230.73,
          "end": 232.92000000000002,
          "en": "And in the most basic form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 232.92000000000002,
          "end": 235.53,
          "en": "that's all we have to do here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 235.53,
          "end": 237.66,
          "en": "because since this is a request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 237.66,
          "end": 240.39,
          "en": "that changes something on the backend,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 240.39,
          "end": 244.98,
          "en": "we don't necessarily have to wait for the response here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 244.98,
          "end": 247.2,
          "en": "I mean, later we will do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 247.2,
          "end": 250.08,
          "en": "because we wanna close this checkout form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 250.08,
          "end": 251.7,
          "en": "once the response is there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 251.7,
          "end": 254.88,
          "en": "and we also wanna handle errors,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 254.88,
          "end": 258.99,
          "en": "but to get started and to see whether this works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 258.99,
          "end": 261.93,
          "en": "it's enough to send this request like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 261.93,
          "end": 263.7,
          "en": "because it will hit the backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 263.7,
          "end": 266.853,
          "en": "and there this data can be extracted and stored.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 268.11,
          "end": 271.71,
          "en": "And therefore with that, we can save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 271.71,
          "end": 274.38,
          "en": "we can go back here, and reload this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 274.38,
          "end": 277.803,
          "en": "and add a couple of items to the cart like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 278.76,
          "end": 283.14300000000003,
          "en": "go to the Checkout screen, and enter some details here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 284.1,
          "end": 286.323,
          "en": "Any dummy details you want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 290.94,
          "end": 291.773,
          "en": "like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 292.83,
          "end": 295.17,
          "en": "and if you click Submit Order",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 295.17,
          "end": 297.09000000000003,
          "en": "nothing will happen here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 297.09000000000003,
          "end": 299.49,
          "en": "But you also shouldn't get an error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 299.49,
          "end": 302.16,
          "en": "and behind the scenes in the Network tab,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 302.16,
          "end": 304.26,
          "en": "if you click Submit Order again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 304.26,
          "end": 308.103,
          "en": "you should see that an HTTP request is being sent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 309.15,
          "end": 311.01,
          "en": "Technically it's two requests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 311.01,
          "end": 313.29,
          "en": "but that's just because it's a post request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 313.29,
          "end": 316.53,
          "en": "which is always preceded with an OPTIONS request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 316.53,
          "end": 320.4,
          "en": "but it's this post request that's also being sent here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 320.4,
          "end": 321.84,
          "en": "and as you see here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 321.84,
          "end": 325.593,
          "en": "it also got back a success status code from the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 326.67,
          "end": 329.46,
          "en": "And you can also validate that it worked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 329.46,
          "end": 331.14,
          "en": "if you go back to your project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 331.14,
          "end": 332.82,
          "en": "and into this backend folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 332.82,
          "end": 335.19,
          "en": "and you take a look at this orders.json file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 335.19,
          "end": 336.423,
          "en": "in the data folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 337.35,
          "end": 340.86,
          "en": "This is the file to which those dummy orders are written",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 340.86,
          "end": 344.15999999999997,
          "en": "if they make it past all these checks in my backend here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 344.15999999999997,
          "end": 346.233,
          "en": "So if we submitted valid data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 347.15999999999997,
          "end": 350.46,
          "en": "And here, if you press the auto format shortcut,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 350.46,
          "end": 354.39,
          "en": "you should therefore indeed see that I have two orders here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 354.39,
          "end": 357.39300000000003,
          "en": "because I pressed the Submit Order button twice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 358.29,
          "end": 362.25,
          "en": "I got this order and this order, two order objects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 362.25,
          "end": 365.4,
          "en": "and every order object has an items array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 365.4,
          "end": 367.5,
          "en": "with the items that were ordered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 367.5,
          "end": 369.63,
          "en": "including the quantity,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 369.63,
          "end": 373.263,
          "en": "and the customer object with the customer details I entered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 374.1,
          "end": 376.83,
          "en": "and an automatically generated order ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 376.83,
          "end": 378.993,
          "en": "which was generated on the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 380.37,
          "end": 382.38,
          "en": "So this is working,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 382.38,
          "end": 384.3,
          "en": "submitting this data works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 384.3,
          "end": 388.353,
          "en": "and therefore in theory we could, of course, stop here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 389.22,
          "end": 393.27,
          "en": "but the user experience, of course, here isn't that great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 393.27,
          "end": 395.52,
          "en": "If something goes wrong,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 395.52,
          "end": 397.74,
          "en": "we wouldn't see an error message here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 397.74,
          "end": 399.65999999999997,
          "en": "and if we click Submit Order,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 399.65999999999997,
          "end": 403.59000000000003,
          "en": "we also get no feedback whether that worked or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 403.59000000000003,
          "end": 407.67,
          "en": "So these are, of course, things we might wanna improve.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 407.67,
          "end": 410.43,
          "en": "And the same, by the way, is true here for the meals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 410.43,
          "end": 413.82,
          "en": "When we reload the page, we're fetching those meals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 413.82,
          "end": 416.28,
          "en": "But what if something goes wrong here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
